[!eq,,%1%]
  wr This is Rev. 4 of the Dungeon game.
  wr There are four difficulty levels available:
  wr ,,,1 - Hacker
  wr ,,,2 - Experienced
  wr ,,,3 - Pro
  wr ,,,4 - Suicidal
  wr
  wr To supress this display[!as 254] give the difficulty level&
     as an argument.
  wr Example: DG 3  or DUNGEON 3
  wr
  st [!r Which level do you wish to attempt? ]
  wr 
  [!eq,[!st],1]
    wr Commands are read as the first letter of the desired command.
    wr For example¬ to enter the command ATTACK¬ you type an A
    wr without a 'NEW LINE' or 'CR'. The program reads each letter as
    wr it is typed and finishes typing the rest of the command for you.
    wr At any time you may type an H to get HELP.
    wr
    wr [!r Type a 'NEW LINE' to begin playing. ]
  [!enD]
[!el]
  st %1%
[!enD]
x dg.pr [!st]
